PNV 1
EPISTEMIC CHYBA
MODE READ_ONLY
# CONTRACT PIP_THOUGHT_C4_TRANSPORT_V0_3
# Exact Gaussian integer sector: all four unit phase rotations.
# The source edge owner selects its declared orientation; no selection here.
OP X SOURCE amplitude.real
OP Y SOURCE amplitude.imag
OP NX DIFFERENCE 0 X
OP NY DIFFERENCE 0 Y
OP R0 COMPOSITION X Y
OP R1 COMPOSITION NY X
OP R2 COMPOSITION NX NY
OP R3 COMPOSITION Y NX
OP ROTATIONS COMPOSITION R0 R1 R2 R3
EMIT ROTATIONS
